Four files carry the two statement-semantic linters this repository's statement
pre-filter battery runs:

  FormalConjecturesForMathlib/Lean/Elab/InfoTree/Util.lean
  FormalConjecturesForMathlib/Tactic/Linter/Term.lean
  FormalConjecturesUtil/Linters/ExistsImplicationLinter.lean
  FormalConjecturesUtil/Linters/StubLinter.lean

Upstream pins mathlib v4.27.0; this repository pins leanprover/lean4:v4.34.0-rc1, so a
lake `require` on the upstream package would drag the toolchain backward. The four files
build against v4.34.0-rc1 with no mathlib and two import edits, reproduced literally here.
`withSetOptionIn` moved from Lean.Elab.Command to Lean.Linter.Basic between those versions.

--- upstream/FormalConjecturesForMathlib/Tactic/Linter/Term.lean
+++ vendored/FormalConjecturesForMathlib/Tactic/Linter/Term.lean
@@ -17,4 +17,5 @@
 module
 
+public import Lean.Linter.Basic
 public import Lean.Meta.Basic
 public import Lean.Elab.Command
--- upstream/FormalConjecturesUtil/Linters/StubLinter.lean
+++ vendored/FormalConjecturesUtil/Linters/StubLinter.lean
@@ -16,5 +16,5 @@
 module
 
-public import Mathlib.Tactic.Linter.Header
+public meta import Lean.Linter.Basic
 
 /-! # The Stub Linter

